 p('Forces and motion','**W = mg. Work = Fs. F = ke. M = Fd.**','**s = vt. a = (v − u)/t. v² − u² = 2as. F = ma.**','Use resultant force, extension and perpendicular distance.','**p = mv. F = Δp/Δt.** Include direction.'),
 p('Waves and images','**T = 1/f. v = fλ.**','Echo distance = vt/2, because time covers both journeys.','Magnification = image height/object height. No unit.','Frequency stays constant across a medium boundary.'),
